  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Moored Sediment Trap Data - La Perouse, 1982-present",
  "description": "Data from sediment traps moored at La Perouse Bank, at station P4 at a depth of 700m, from 1982-2000.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Studying the biogeochemical flux between the deep ocean and the continental shelf.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Custodian will be leaving soon and has a large quantity of data not secured in a regional data centre. Risk of Loss: High Impact Justification: Long term time series (more than 10 years) Impact of Loss: High Recommended Action: Bring data to archives",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23629169",
